# Wilderland Scrounger, a 3/6: "Ferocious - Whenever this creature attacks while you control a creature with power 4 or greater, put
# a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." On turn 3 Bot1 controls a Scrounger (power 3) and an Ornithopter: attacking
# triggers nothing. An Alpine Grizzly (power 4) arrives after combat. On turn 5 the Scrounger attacks and each of Bot1's three
# creatures gets exactly one counter; Bot2's Ornithopter gets none. (The Scrounger, now 4/7, would count itself later.)

